msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_7"
msgid "If I couldn't be on TV,{PA:10} I wanted to be a||police officer.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_8"
msgid "It {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}was fun.{PA:20} I got to wear a uniform.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_9"
msgid "I wish I could've said that one line,{PA:10}||though.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_10"
msgid "What line?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_11"
msgid "You're under arrest!{PA:20}❤{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}||Wouldn't that be cute?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_12"
msgid "Yes.{PA:20} But not very intimidating.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_13"
msgid "You {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}went to the perverted thoughts||right away.{PA:20} You're dirtier than I thought!{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_14"
msgid "No,{PA:10} I'm just human.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_15"
msgid "You {MS:1}{MS:0}think a TV personality like||me would have to pose naked,{PA:10} don't you?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_16"
msgid "Just because someone's in show business||doesn't mean they do stuff like that.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_17"
msgid "Is that the {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}only thing people||think about?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_18"
msgid "Yeah,{PA:10} {MS:1}{MS:0}there are a lot||of scandals in those weekly magazines.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_19"
msgid "But {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}my agency was strict.{PA:20}||I never had time for scandals,{PA:10} to be honest.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_20"
msgid "You were that busy?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_10_21"
msgid "During peak times,{PA:10} I didn't get||more than three hours of sleep a night.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_0"
msgid "T{MS:0}he other day,{PA:10} I went to a used book store||and they were selling my photo book.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_1"
msgid "How much do you think it cost?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_2"
msgid "My {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}photo book's first printing||was going for 25,{PA:10}000 yen!{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_3"
msgid "Just the{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0} opposite,{PA:10} in fact.{PA:20}||When it first went on sale,{PA:10} it didn't sell.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_4"
msgid "So now they're like treasures for the||obsessed collectors out there.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_5"
msgid "You were that unpopular?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_6"
msgid "I {MS:1}{MS:0}had just debuted,{PA:10} and||there was hardly any PR.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_7"
msgid "But I had an okay look going.{PA:20} The pictures||from that time are my favorite.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_8"
msgid "I'd like to see them.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_9"
msgid "O{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}kay,{PA:10} maybe next time!{PA:20}❤"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_10"
msgid "You{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}'re smart,{PA:10} Kazuma.{PA:20}||Yeah.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20} I was only a minor star.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_11"
msgid "W{MS:0}hen I debuted,{PA:10} I didn't have style.{PA:20}||I was like a country girl.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_12"
msgid "Is that a factor in popularity?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_13"
msgid "Y{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}eah,{PA:10} I looked clueless.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_14"
msgid "But I kind of miss what I was like back||i{MS:0}n those days.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_15"
msgid "I see.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_16"
msgid "Is {MS:1}{MS:0}that too expensive?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_17"
msgid "It isn't cheap.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_18"
msgid "But it lets you see a young,{PA:10} naive,{PA:10}||blossoming me!{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_19"
msgid "I'd rather drink with the real thing.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_20"
msgid "A{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}w,{PA:10} that's so nice!{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_11_21"
msgid "I try.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_0"
msgid "K{MS:0}azuma,{PA:10} is there anything||you don't like about your face?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_1"
msgid "I don't even think about it.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_2"
msgid "Hee hee!{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}{PA:20} A long time ago,{PA:10}||I used to hate my face.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_3"
msgid "But then I grew to love it.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_4"
msgid "N{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}o.{PA:20} Does||it look like I've had work done?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_5"
msgid "Your face is pretty nice.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_6"
msgid "I {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}can't tell if you're complimenting||me or criticizing me.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_7"
msgid "Anyway,{PA:10} I've never had plastic surgery,{PA:10}||although my agency did recommend it.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_8"
msgid "Some people's self-image can be improved||by plastic surgery.{PA:20} I don't deny that.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_9"
msgid "But I figured that I'd be||{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}happier if people liked me as I was.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_10"
msgid "That makes sense.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_11"
msgid "Something {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}a guy said hurt me.{PA:20}||A guy I liked when I was in junior high.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_12"
msgid "Junior high is an easy time for a||girl to gain weight.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_13"
msgid "H{MS:0}e laughed at me,{PA:10} and said||I should get plastic surgery.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_14"
msgid "Kids can be cruel.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_15"
msgid "H{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}m.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20} This is bringing||back some bad memories.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_16"
msgid "A{MS:1}{MS:0}mazing,{PA:10} Kazuma.{PA:20}❤||How did you know?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_17"
msgid "On one of those practical joke shows,{PA:10} they||showed my face without makeup.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_18"
msgid "After that,{PA:10} I received a fan letter||from an elementary school girl.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_19"
msgid "She said,{PA:10} {MS:0}\"I want to have a face like||yours--pretty without even wearing makeup\".{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_20"
msgid "T{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}hanks to her,{PA:10} I gained||a lot of confidence in my face.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_21"
msgid "They were magic words.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_12_22"
msgid "Yes.{PA:20} {MS:3}{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}You're surprisingly||astute,{PA:10} Kazuma!{PA:20}❤"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_0"
msgid "The other day,{MS:0}{PA:10} I went to a hookup party||with a famous comedian.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_1"
msgid "Everyone around him was just||shrieking with laughter.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_2"
msgid "I got so tired of his||constant dirty jokes,{PA:10} though.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_3"
msgid "Yeah,{PA:10} that can be grating.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_4"
msgid "Y{MS:0}eah.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20} Do you ever go||to hookup parties,{PA:10} Kazuma?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_5"
msgid "I{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0} see.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_6"
msgid "When you {MS:0}go,{PA:10} do you only||think about what'll happen that night?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_7"
msgid "I just see how things play out.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_8"
msgid "O{MS:0}h.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20} But I just can't picture it.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_9"
msgid "You trying to pick up a||young girl at a party.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_10"
msgid "What {MS:1}{MS:0}are you looking for?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_11"
msgid "If you went,{PA:10} I'd think about going.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_12"
msgid "C'{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}mon.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}||You're always here drinking,{PA:10} aren't you?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_13"
msgid "Can I try to pick you up here?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_14"
msgid "I{MS:1}{MS:0}f you think you can,{PA:10} give it a try!{PA:20}||Hee {MS:2}hee!{PA:20}❤"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_15"
msgid "Hm?{PA:20}||Yeah.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20} {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}I can see that.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_16"
msgid "D{MS:0}o guys only think||with their nether regions?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_13_17"
msgid ".{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_0"
msgid "K{MS:0}azuma,{PA:10} have you ever seen pictures||of me from my television days?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_1"
msgid "No,{PA:10} I haven't.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_2"
msgid "Those pictures were a lot harder to take||than they might appear.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_3"
msgid "I've even cried because of them.{PA:20}||Why do you think I cried?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_4"
msgid "Some photographers were rumored to be jerks.{PA:20}||B{MS:1}{MS:0}ut all my photographers were kind.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_5"
msgid "S{MS:0}ometimes,{PA:10} though,{PA:10} they'd ask me out||or ogle me when we were done shooting.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_6"
msgid "You didn't like that?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_7"
msgid "H{MS:0}ow can I put it.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20} When I was ogled,{PA:10}||it freaked me out a little bit.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_8"
msgid ".{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_9"
msgid "Oh,{PA:10} {MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}this is a depressing topic.{PA:20}||Let's talk about something else.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_10"
msgid "T{MS:1}{MS:0}hat happened before.{PA:20}||But I wasn't forced.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_11"
msgid "Some people are really good at talking you||into doing things.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_12"
msgid "Did you strip?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_13"
msgid "Do you really want to know?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_14"
msgid ".{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_15"
msgid "U{MS:0}nfortunately,{PA:10} my manager put||a stop to it.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_16"
msgid "I see.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_17"
msgid "P{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}hoto shoots are surprisingly||hard work.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_18"
msgid "The poses can feel unnatural,{PA:10} and sometimes||you have to go to dangerous places.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_19"
msgid "It's actually pretty tiring.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_20"
msgid "I see.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_21"
msgid "Once,{PA:10} during a shoot,{PA:10} I had||a fever and I collapsed.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_22"
msgid "We kept to the schedule,{PA:10}||b{MS:2}{MS:1}{MS:0}ut I caused problems for everyone.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_14_23"
msgid "That's why I cried.{PA:20}||I was very young at the time.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_15_0"
msgid "I {MS:0}get the feeling you'd be a||good manager for young actresses.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_15_1"
msgid "Why do you say that?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_15_2"
msgid "You're honest-seeming,{PA:10} for one thing.{PA:20}||Plus you seem dependable.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_15_3"
msgid "And if a client asks something unreasonable,{PA:10}||you seem like you'd fight for the girls.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_15_4"
msgid "You wouldn't back down even if you were||t{MS:0}hreatened,{PA:10} would you?{PA:20}"
