msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_18_21"
msgid "When you're old,{PA:10} that's when you tire||of normal things,{PA:10} like plain nakedness.{PA:20}"
