msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_19_6"
msgid "When I'm alone a lot,{PA:10} I get into my head||a {MS:1}{MS:0}little too much.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/MSG/CABA/TALK_CABAJYO_C_02_US.BIN::line:9_19_7"
msgid "So I try to get out of the house when I can.{PA:20}||It keeps my head clear.{PA:20}"
